<Legal title="Subprocessors" description="The service providers that process data for the hosted FlutterProbe services and this website, and what each one receives." other="/subencargados/">
  <p>This is a translation for your convenience; the <a href="/subencargados/" hreflang="es">Spanish version</a> prevails if the two differ.</p>
  <p>This page lists the companies that process data on our behalf for the hosted FlutterProbe services and for this website, and what each one receives. It does not cover the command line tool, the Dart agent or Probe Studio: they run on your machine and send nothing to us unless you upload to a hosted service. The <a href="/privacy/">privacy notice</a> says what we do with the data.</p>

  <h2>Stripe</h2>
  <p><strong>What for:</strong> payments and billing: checkout, invoices and the billing portal.</p>
  <p><strong>What it receives:</strong> the billing email address and the payment details you enter at Stripe, and the customer, subscription and invoice records of your team. We never receive or store full card numbers.</p>

  <h2>Cloudflare</h2>
  <p><strong>What for:</strong> hosting and storage of the hosted services: the service that receives run reports, the dashboard, the payment and mail services, and the storage behind them.</p>
  <p><strong>What it receives:</strong> the requests the hosted services handle and the data they store, including the run reports you upload and the account data of your team.</p>

  <h2>Resend</h2>
  <p><strong>What for:</strong> delivery of the emails the hosted services send: licence messages, renewal notices and the link to the billing portal.</p>
  <p><strong>What it receives:</strong> the recipient's email address, the subject and text of each message (a licence email contains the licence key) and the delivery events that come back to us (sent, delivered, bounced). Its sending region is in the United States of America.</p>

  <h2>GitHub</h2>
  <p><strong>What for:</strong> hosting this website (GitHub Pages).</p>
  <p><strong>What it receives:</strong> the IP address and the browser details of each request for a page of this website. It receives no account data and no run reports. GitHub is not used to sign in to the hosted services.</p>

  <h2>Where data is stored</h2>
  <p>These providers operate in several countries, including the United States of America. We have not verified in which region each one stores data, and we do not promise that your data stays in one region.</p>

  <h2>Changes to this list</h2>
  <p>We update this page before a new provider starts to process data. The version and date at the top of the page change with it.</p>

  <h2>Data processing agreement</h2>
  <p>Organisations that need a data processing agreement for the hosted services can ask for one at <a href="mailto:support@alphawavesystems.com">support@alphawavesystems.com</a>.</p>
</Legal>
